Package: OvintivExplorer
Title: Ovintiv O&G Explorer — MCP Chat Interface
Version: 0.1.0
Description: A Shiny chat application that connects to the Ovintiv O&G Explorer
    FastMCP server hosted on Posit Connect and exposes a natural-language interface
    for exploring synthetic well inventory, production histories, completion designs,
    type curves, and economics across four unconventional plays.
Author: Ovintiv Demo
License: Proprietary
Depends: R (>= 4.3.0)
Imports:
    shiny,
    bslib,
    shinychat,
    elmer,
    purrr
